# Used when the build context is the repository root: docker build -f demo/Dockerfile .
# Only the source tree, the committed data the demo reads and the demo folder reach the build stage.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!data/eval_results.json
!demo/app.py
!demo/requirements-demo.txt
!demo/wheels/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
